[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_NORTHERN_HARBOUR]
Northern Harbour

[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_NORTHERN_HARBOUR_desc]
Look around the Northern Luna Sea, our neighbors: yaks, shapeshifters, reindeers. They all seem to have no interest in this sea area.\n“Knock, Knock！”\n§g“Who is it?”§!\n“Your neighbor Sire’s Hollow. I just picked up the Northern Luna Sea, it fell out of your pocket, didn’t it?”\n§g“I guess... no?”§!\n“Wonderful, then it shall be mine.”

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_NORTHERN_HARBOUR]
北部港湾

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_NORTHERN_HARBOUR_desc]
环顾北露娜洋边上我们的邻居：牦牛、幻形灵、驯鹿。他们似乎都对这片海域没什么兴趣。\n“敲，敲！”\n§g“谁？”§!\n“你的邻居名流谷。我刚刚捡到了北露娜洋，是从你你口袋里掉出来的吧？”\n§g“可能...不是？”§!\n“太好了，那它就是我的了。”

